{"title":"学习 Rust - Rust 程序设计语言","description":"一门帮助每个人构建可靠且高效软件的语言。","html":"<header class=\"mt3 mt2-ns mb4 mb5-ns tc tl-ns\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <h1>学习 Rust</h1>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section id=\"learn-begin\" class=\"green\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>开启您的 Rust 之旅</h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"flex flex-column flex-row-l pv0-l\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-column-l justify-between-l mw8 measure-wide-l pb4 pb5-m pb0-ns ph4-l\">\n        <div class=\"v-top pt3-l measure-wide-l flex-l flex-column-l flex-auto-l\">\n          <p class=\"flex-grow-1\"><strong>《Rust 程序设计语言》</strong>被亲切地称为“圣经”。本书从基本原则出发，给出了\n        Rust 语言的概览。您将在阅读本书的过程中构建几个项目，读完本书后，您就能扎实地掌握 Rust 语言。</p>\n          <div class=\"buttons\">\n            <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/\">阅读本书！</a>\n            <a class=\"button-additional\" href=\"https://kaisery.github.io/trpl-zh-cn/\">阅读非官方翻译</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-column-l justify-between-l mw8 measure-wide-l pb4 pb5-m pb0-ns ph4-l\">\n        <div class=\"v-top pt3-l measure-wide-l flex-l flex-column-l flex-auto-l\">\n          <p class=\"flex-grow-1\">如果您不喜欢阅读大量的文档来学习语言，那么《通过例子学 Rust》就能涵盖您要学的知识。虽然本书花了很多篇幅来解释代码，但它展示的代码很丰富，并且尽量减少了文字解释。它还包括很多练习！</p>\n          <div class=\"buttons\">\n            <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/rust-by-example/\">阅读《通过例子学 Rust》！</a>\n            <a class=\"button-additional\" href=\"https://rustwiki.org/zh-CN/rust-by-example/\">阅读非官方翻译</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-column-l justify-between-l mw8 measure-wide-l pb4 pb5-m pb0-ns ph4-l\">\n        <div class=\"v-top pt3-l measure-wide-l flex-l flex-column-l flex-auto-l\">\n          <p class=\"flex-grow-1\">此外，Rustlings 课程会指导您下载并设置 Rust 工具链，在命令行中教您阅读和编写 Rust 代码的语法基础。它可以运行在您自己的环境中，是《通过例子学 Rust》之外的另一种选择。</p>\n          <div class=\"buttons\">\n            <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rustlings/\">学习 Rustlings 课程！</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"learn-use\" class=\"white\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2 class=\"black\">\n        与 Rust 共同成长\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <div>\n      <h3>阅读核心文档</h3>\n      <p>以下所有文档都可以用 <code>rustup doc</code> 命令在本地阅读，它会在您的浏览器中离线打开这些资源！</p>\n\n      <section class=\"flex flex-column\">\n        <div class=\"pt3 flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n          <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/index.html\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">标准库</a>\n          <p class=\"pl4-l ma0-l mt1 mb3\">\n            详尽的 Rust 标准库 API 手册。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt4 pt3-l flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n          <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/edition-guide/index.html\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">版本指南</a>\n          <p class=\"pl4-l ma0-l mt1 mb3\">\n            Rust 版本指南。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt4 pt3-l flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n          <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/index.html\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">Cargo 手册</a>\n          <p class=\"pl4-l ma0-l mt1 mb3\">\n            Rust 的包管理器和构建系统。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt4 pt3-l flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n          <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustdoc/index.html\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">rustdoc 手册</a>\n          <p class=\"pl4-l ma0-l mt1 mb3\">\n            学习如何为您的 crate 编写完美的文档。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt4 pt3-l flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n          <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustc/index.html\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">rustc 手册</a>\n          <p class=\"pl4-l ma0-l mt1 mb3\">\n            熟悉 Rust 编译器中可用的选项。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt4 pt3-l flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n          <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/error-index.html\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">编译错误索引表</a>\n          <p class=\"pl4-l mb0 mt1 ma0-l\">\n            深入解释了您可能会遇到的编译错误。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n    <hr/>\n    <div>\n      <h3>在应用领域中点亮您的技能树</h3>\n        <section class=\"flex flex-column\">\n          <div class=\"pt3 flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n            <a href=\"https://rust-cli.github.io/book/index.html\"\n               class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">\n              命令行手册\n            </a>\n            <p class=\"pl4-l ma0-l mt1 mb3\">\n              学习如何用 Rust 构建高效的命令行应用。\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pt4 pt3-l flex flex-column flex-row-l items-center-l mb4-l\">\n            <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/embedded-book\"\n               class=\"button button-secondary mw6-l w-100\">\n              嵌入式手册\n            </a>\n            <p class=\"pl4-l mb0 mt1 ma0-l\">\n              熟练掌握用 Rust 编写微控制器和其它嵌入式系统程序。\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"learn-master\" class=\"purple\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>精通 Rust</h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <p>对 Rust 中的黑魔法感到好奇？在这里，您可以深入理解其本质。</p>\n    <section class=\"flex flex-column flex-row-l pv0-l\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-column-l justify-between-l mw8 measure-wide-l pv4 pv5-m pv6-ns ph4-l\">\n        <div class=\"v-top tc-l\">\n          <img src=\"/images/reference.svg\" alt=\"书架图标\"\n               class=\"mw3 mw4-ns\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"v-top pl4 pl0-l pt0 pt3-l measure-wide-l flex-l flex-column-l flex-auto-l justify-between-l\">\n          <p>《参考手册》并非正式的语言规范，但它比“圣经”更加详尽而全面。</p>\n          <a class=\"button button-secondary\"\n             href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/index.html\">\n            阅读《参考手册》\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-column-l justify-between-l mw8 measure-wide-l pv4 pv5-m pv6-ns ph4-l\">\n        <div class=\"v-top tc-l\">\n          <img src=\"/images/nomicon.svg\" alt=\"双手捧火\"\n               class=\"mw3 mw4-ns\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"v-top pl4 pl0-l pt0 pt3-l measure-wide-l flex-l flex-column-l flex-auto-l justify-between-l\">\n          <p>《Rust 秘典》是 Unsafe Rust 的黑魔法指南。它有时被称作“死灵书”。</p>\n\n          <a class=\"button button-secondary\"\n             href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/nomicon/index.html\">\n            阅读《Rust 秘典》\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"button-additional\" href=\"https://nomicon.purewhite.io/\">阅读非官方翻译</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-column-l justify-between-l mw8 measure-wide-l pv3 pv5-m pv6-ns ph4-l\">\n        <div class=\"v-top tc-l\">\n          <img src=\"/images/unstable.svg\" alt=\"手洒星光\"\n               class=\"mw3 mw4-ns\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"v-top pl4 pl0-l pt0 pt3-l measure-wide-l flex-l flex-column-l flex-auto-l justify-between-l\">\n          <p>《未稳定特性手册》覆盖了当前只能在 nightly Rust 中使用的还未稳定的特性。</p>\n          <a class=\"button button-secondary\"\n             href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/unstable-book/index.html\">\n            阅读《未稳定特性手册》\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</section>"}